  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato, carrot and beetroot into fries.\n• Place fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Spread out evenly, then bake until golden and tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggie fries between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8ccea18d6e477003fca87/step-a974e400.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, cook plant-based crumbed chicken and mild Caribbean jerk seasoning (see ingredients), for 2-3 minutes each side until golden.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8ccea18d6e477003fca87/step-7427d910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While plant-based crumbed chicken is cooking, add trimmed green beans and a splash of water to a microwave-safe bowl, then cover with a damp paper towel.\n• Microwave green beans on high until just tender, 2-4 minutes.\n• Drain green beans, then return to the bowl and cover to keep warm.\n• Slice lime into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8ccea18d6e477003fca87/step-da148520.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide jerk-spiced plant-based crumbed chicken and veggie fries between plates.\n• Tear over coriander and serve with lime wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8ccea18d6e477003fca87/step-4ceb3830.jpg"
    }
  ]
